{title:Title}

{p 4 4 2}
{cmd:trop} {hline 2} Triply robust panel estimators

{marker description}{...}
{title:Description}

{pstd}
{cmd:trop} implements triply robust panel estimators for treatment-effect estimation in panel data.

{pstd}
This help file is a placeholder and will be expanded as the command develops.

{marker examples}{...}
{title:Examples}

{p 8 8 2}
{cmd:. trop y id time treated}

